7  | | b=c
   | |----
8  | | S(b,b)                 = Elim: 3, 6
9  | | S(b,c)                 = Elim: 8, 7
10 | | ⊥                      ⊥ Intro: 9, 4
11 | ¬(b=c)                   ¬ Intro: 7-10
